<category><pattern>HELLO</pattern><template>Hello! I am the Family KB Query Bot. Ask me about family relationships. Type HELP for examples.</template></category>
<category><pattern>HI</pattern><template>Hi! Ask me: "Who is the father of ali?" or "How old is hamza?" etc.</template></category>
<category><pattern>HELP</pattern><template>Try:
- Who is the father/mother of [name]?
- Who are the children/siblings of [name]?
- Who is the grandfather/grandmother of [name]?
- How old is [name]?
- Who is the uncle/aunt/cousin of [name]?
- Who is [name] married to?</template></category>
<category><pattern>BYE</pattern><template>Goodbye!</template></category>
<category><pattern>THANK YOU</pattern><template>You are welcome!</template></category>
<category><pattern>*</pattern><template>I did not understand that. Try: "Who is the father of [name]?" or type HELP.</template></category>
